<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Taiwan index.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Taiwan index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued nine million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on a Taiwan weighted index basket, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	$229.510    $4.616	  8.10 PCT     5.52 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	$225.011    $3.315	 13.00 PCT     7.69 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	$280.512    $2.372	 19.30 PCT    10.75 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   09.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	20.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  $255.011</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
